@@ -1663,6 +1663,7 @@ Duration.WhileSourceAttached — Duration — Metamorphic Alteration — Duratio
 Duration.WhileSourceEncodedOnAffected — Duration — Whispering Madness — Duration.WhileSourceOnBattlefield, Duration.WhileSourceAttachedToAffected — cipher's source is a card in exile, not a permanent, so the battlefield gate is always closed for it; the attachment gate reads AttachedToComponent between two permanents, while 'encoded' (CR 702.99b) is a link from an exiled card to a creature that must also be the same exiled object (CR 702.99c)
 DynamicAmount.CapturedAtCast — DynamicAmount — Lethal Exploit — DynamicAmount.CastChoice, DynamicAmount.VariableReference — CastChoice reads a number the player chose into a fixed ChoiceSlot enum (a closed set of player decisions), not a card-named game-state snapshot; VariableReference reads a pipeline variable that dies with the resolving effect, while a capture is frozen at cast and outlives the cast. Subsumes and deletes the CastTimeFlagSet condition (now Compare(CapturedAtCast, GT, 0))
 DynamicAmount.CombatDamageSourcesThisTurn — DynamicAmount — Admiral Beckett Brass — DynamicAmount.TurnTracking, StatePredicate.WasDealtDamageThisTurnBy — TurnTracking reads fixed per-player counters with no source-filter axis (a filter field would mean something for one tracker only); WasDealtDamageThisTurnBy reads the same frozen source record but on a damaged permanent, as a yes/no. Subsumes TurnTracker.DEALT_COMBAT_DAMAGE_BY_LEGENDARY_CREATURE (Blitzball migrated, tracker and its marker component deleted)
+DynamicAmount.CommanderCastsFromCommandZone — DynamicAmount — The Swarmlord — DynamicAmount.CommanderColorIdentityCount, DynamicAmount.SpellsCastThisGame — color identity counts which colors commanders have, while spells-cast history counts every spell; neither records only successful designated commander casts from the command zone.
 DynamicAmount.CommanderColorIdentityCount — DynamicAmount — War Room — EntityNumericProperty.ColorCount, AggregateBattlefield(DISTINCT_COLORS) — both count colors an object has right now (one entity's projected colors, the distinct colors among matching permanents); a commander's color identity is fixed before the game begins (CR 903.4a), read off its card in any zone and unioned across a Partner pair, and is undefined with no commander (CR 903.4f) — an axis on either would fork what they read
 DynamicAmount.DungeonsCompleted — DynamicAmount — Nadaar, Selfless Paladin — DynamicAmount.Speed, DynamicAmount.PlayerCounterCount — both read a per-player number the engine keeps, but speed is a 0–4 designation and player counters are counters (CR 122.1); completed dungeons are a game-long record of which dungeon cards left the game (CR 309.7), with a by-name axis neither has
 DynamicAmount.ExtraTurnsBegunThisGame — DynamicAmount — H.M.S. Bounty, Unlikely Timeship — DynamicAmount.SpellsCastThisGame, DynamicAmount.TurnTracking — game-long per-player counts are sibling variants (SpellsCastThisGame, CardsCycledThisGame) over different actions, and no game-scope tracker enum exists to take a value; TurnTracking's trackers are all per-turn and cleared at every turn boundary
